    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_57639039ea68fa03dcffdfe2",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "1）构造柱设置要求及做法见结施。门、窗、配电箱、消火栓等洞口边形成独立砖柱宽度小于等于240mm、混凝土柱或剪力墙边门垛小于240mm、\n窗间墙小于360mm时，砖柱改用钢筋混凝土构造柱。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_5c23e0e7d6bf83ec5aa030fb",
        "ent_efef0ea6bbc27ac6a467212e",
        "ent_50d6e41df74a0e2df9e9bb96",
        "ent_1c06b0ae218eb2f0d602d437",
        "ent_bee34f9164d4df29fbd72688",
        "ent_0672ce4d52fdd340000cb8f8",
        "ent_177526c0dadfe3ac26d93170",
        "ent_c3584b04fc2bfee470140177",
        "ent_08c514e7b0ced867334e06a2"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -659392.8208673454,
        1373885.8169083833,
        -658052.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_c5af05ccc92939cb07a72f24",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "2）宽度大于300mm的预留洞口应设钢筋混凝土过梁，过梁做法见结施。过梁伸入每边墙体的长度不应小于250,墙体材料为加气混凝土砌块时，过梁\n伸入墙体长度不应小于300mm，且其支承面下应设置混凝土梁垫。当门窗洞上口至梁底距离小于200mm时，门窗过梁应与结构梁整浇。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_3e037f3a699a2789e346c0fd",
        "ent_c7062f98179ae61dc478f963",
        "ent_333492c11e8cc01e6004303b",
        "ent_5b2251dfe7f9b1d59d70e970",
        "ent_67011ec40cd6e0d055f8fe96",
        "ent_7905a27ae1a1115d26835470",
        "ent_d037e70a325b9211393bf712",
        "ent_3ca7ec37acfaa55d1c3c7c0b",
        "ent_ecc6aa3aa3a05b04fa792834",
        "ent_9060d3450b65a5801891e660",
        "ent_2e7140cede2a84c4d109bc44"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -660922.8208673454,
        1375992.2273546907,
        -659582.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_80a14e3767fdc6a183678163",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "1",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_e54b94bc94759a429fddfa14"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1373711.7071371311,
        -661422.5950639355,
        1373840.200822712,
        -661039.3344528717
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_afce98808151a2a8d6937138",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "3）窗台处设置钢筋混凝土窗台板，纵筋3Φ8，分布筋Φ6@200，两端到混凝土柱墙结束或嵌入两端墙体墙体600。图中另有表述的除外。详见附图：",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_59a470770afb1b1500a200ab",
        "ent_5962699a0914539c21bd667c",
        "ent_d604c0183d23dfdc1f0d41c4",
        "ent_e721aaeca0c9ca7eb7eeb163",
        "ent_2dc8e0878943ed27c5932838",
        "ent_44bdb44f07c1de12f3a64d49",
        "ent_3a04c1c116322ed89921f914",
        "ent_c2a6f28dfacee8f64cada238"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -661687.8208673454,
        1375765.9416404045,
        -661112.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_ab17ba5b7d855d004a5d771f",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "总8",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_3251ec585f14e472e3197d06"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1373610.652887528,
        -661773.2606864253,
        1373941.255072314,
        -661433.3164929211
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad",
        "region_afce98808151a2a8d6937138"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_0367fb9e4f23d99171100a33",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "4）墙体与构造柱或混凝土墙交接处，设拉结钢筋见结施。采用加气混凝土砌块墙体时，应预先在砌块的水平灰缝面开设通长的凹槽（槽宽、深度比\n钢筋大10mm），置入钢筋后，应用粘结剂或DPM7.5水泥砂浆填实至槽的上口平。楼梯间和人流通道的填充墙，尚应采用钢丝网(Φ4@200双向)砂浆\n面层加强，疏散部位施工完成后不应影响疏散宽度。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_a44445e87d048ce0353debdc",
        "ent_785c9e222be0657054b1f418",
        "ent_f428e0fbde813e3a85c7a941",
        "ent_b5f1d3685eff4e50b0f2c862",
        "ent_3a3449b1639aea080d02c06e",
        "ent_fe3b9ce4ca0610f2bb6ef930",
        "ent_c9a1f467d29c221164adf04e",
        "ent_a145521b0a89a2f388f49310",
        "ent_f2cab23534fbc7020c72b5b8",
        "ent_1098d26734771047f55f1ebe",
        "ent_8f9b95928f9efc8cb72a68f9",
        "ent_a03bbb0e9949338193109702"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -663982.8208673454,
        1382667.2209231958,
        -661877.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_bce507506975d1ed019f417c",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "5）水电管线的暗敷工作，必须待墙体砌完、砂浆强度达到设计要求后方能进行。开槽时，应使用轻型电动切割机并辅手工镂槽器，严禁锤斧剔凿。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_5041be924844d603badf5e24",
        "ent_a9082928274ea81f84bbc612"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -664747.8208673454,
        1382656.9352089097,
        -664172.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_d80080282092f29243106dac",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "开槽深度不宜超过墙厚的1/3，墙厚≤120的墙体不得双向对开管线槽。管线开槽应距门窗洞口300外为宜。导管敷设后，应采用细石混凝土或干硬性\n砂浆填封密实牢固；加气砼墙体应采用用掺入加气砼碎屑的专用砂浆填实。墙体补平宜比墙面微凹2mm,沿槽长外侧粘贴宽度不小于100的耐碱玻璃纤\n维网格布增强。穿防火墙的管线、桥架等部位应采用不燃烧材料将其周围的空隙填塞密实；穿过防火墙的管道保温材料，应采用不燃烧材料。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_b440ffbd5ec4f71e28210638",
        "ent_6984a9fa53ac9bca586b4be1",
        "ent_8fadb01a32e1c3f76dcdb3b1",
        "ent_d0319e19ac18696da765a635",
        "ent_4edfda442a2d53a780015b65",
        "ent_2a72fa1720a74a27cb38d008",
        "ent_1ef3034aa201a5f09a33c348",
        "ent_c997a9c727bf74e0e7ff316f",
        "ent_0473e1f605ff820238e728c3",
        "ent_6bee6c4ee658ab9548bc0631",
        "ent_19bde3b3b7223c679091c8b3",
        "ent_a585c29bbef7892df5718e45",
        "ent_a64a9f9e90c95aaf4ece31e3"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -667042.8208673454,
        1381445.3819054605,
        -664937.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_1765caab194369fea772e7fe",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "6）窗台板、表具箱、配电箱、消火栓箱等与砌体交接处的缝隙应用柔性不燃材料封填。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_4338b6f1580ed73c8cef39b1",
        "ent_b357b76eafddb331109a7282"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -667807.8208673454,
        1369581.0279783502,
        -667232.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_051464e1abc7cc5568831768",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "7）在墙体上预埋铁件时，应用电钻在砌块上钻取所需孔洞，铁件在钻孔内用水玻璃或结构胶粘接。穿过墙体的铁件应作防锈处理。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_cfdc27149f41bc30c4b61a8f",
        "ent_cf371dbb0004b6912808dcc7"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -668572.8208673454,
        1379136.498646836,
        -667997.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_c1d64a931471f9f9be6ad5ab",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "8）用于卫生间的墙体,墙面增加防水层见设计说明装修做法表内墙部分。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_4ddaf45b383cbdf93ba44792",
        "ent_9c1612db8120c9965b3fe0b6",
        "ent_5397515f6fbaba39307f7e94",
        "ent_aca43c2f750eeca0acfd348a"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -669337.8208673454,
        1364866.8872650396,
        -668762.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_3350e320dec7db3fc573beed",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "9）内墙的阳角部位应做不低于2m高的DP-M15预拌水泥砂浆护角，外墙护角应全做。护角宽度50。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_35232cab1dab8d8bb88b05b2",
        "ent_60ff004a70ee13ceccb0a91d",
        "ent_d3b6e388a14160c1d84df584",
        "ent_b63ae3961040387dca2ff95b",
        "ent_5aae1236e30f1f4589b7d991",
        "ent_4ce9ee020466832343202df3",
        "ent_5140ce9b63554514e0261f88",
        "ent_e1d782b7478ccf0408b6144b"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -670102.8208673454,
        1368313.682041886,
        -669527.5821224614
      ],
      "context_region_ids": [
        "region_de0c42bbe08e9a7c6bbc1ae5",
        "region_bb2a0785cfd00eebb75ef7ad"
      ],
      "column_key": "(1349964.372, 1373964.372)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "region_0b6f2d550aff08afd22780ce",
      "layout_id": "layout_147c92ecee6af148b7ac8794",
      "frame_id": "frame_307d2fdc39fded5095c66c24",
      "frame_name": "路住宅项目地上住宅及配套用房部分，地下部分另见地下室建筑设计说明。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "10）墙面抹灰前，基层应清扫干净后再抹或喷专用界面剂处理，界面剂厚度2～3。",
      "entity_ids": [
        "ent_00ce37bd620c42b8b0a9dd99",
        "ent_14bd2d38812a0c0edb914b58",
        "ent_60f08839c82ec91b23268e63",
        "ent_e44154f161e2eae4a686ca94",
        "ent_edd6be1aaf73988f1ed46980",
        "ent_5e9ef642cd8362281c65f8ec"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        1350264.372355665,
        -670867.8208673454,
        1366717.7966394303,
        -670292.5821224614
      ],
